# Hard rule: do not modify `origin/master`-owned classes

This branch tracks `origin/master` for agent logic. Master-owned Kotlin lives in **`:agent-core`** (byte-identical to `origin/master` `app/src/main/java`).

## Do

- Put UI/UX / TTFR work in **`:assistant-ext`**, **`:assistant-ui`**, and **`:assistant-api`**
- Prefer new types in `:assistant-ext`, ports in `:assistant-api`, and manifest / Koin wiring in `:app` / `:assistant-ext`
- After any accidental `:agent-core` edit, restore from `origin/master` into `:agent-core`

## Do not

- Edit `:agent-core` `.kt` files unless **extremely required**
- Copy or “fix” master agent classes in place — extend via the modules above instead

Enforced by `MasterOwnedTreeContractTest` (path-mapped allowlist).
